From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:16:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/56] Hidden Power in the IV/EV editor, HM field moves
 without teaching, optional level caps

- The IV/EV editor shows the Hidden Power type and power for the IVs
- With the HM and its badge, Cut, Surf, Strength, Rock Smash and Waterfall
  work from the overworld; Fly and Flash appear in the party menu
- A scientist in the Viridian City Pokemon Center toggles level caps at
  the next unbeaten Gym Leader's highest level (League after 8 badges,
  none after becoming Champion); capped Pokemon get no Exp. or Rare Candy

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
